first_time_dialogue = "You came from the cavern?

Then the Echo was right to send you here.

Our village can help you, but we have troubles of our own.
The shopkeeper has supplies that could aid you, but something has kept him from properly selling his inventory.

Go speak with him.
If you can help solve his problem, his shop may become useful to you.

You will find him east of here  in the Huut across from me."
active_dialogue = "Speak with the shopkeeper.

He has supplies, but something is keeping him from selling his inventory properly."
ready_to_turn_in_dialogue = "The elder sent you?

Good. I was hoping someone would come by.
I have goods to sell, but I cannot open shop properly while this problem remains.

If you are willing to help, I may be able to trade with you once this is handled."
completed_dialogue = "Talk to me again to learn about the task i have for you."
summary = "The Village Elder asked me to speak with the village shopkeeper."
objective_text = "Speak with the Shopkeeper."
